  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On 21/10/2024, the proposed use of Rear Of 311, Vicarage Farm Road, Hounslow, TW5 0DR as a car body workshop with an office space for administration purposes only as a mini cab office is not lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) because:\r\nThe submitted information fails to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in a material change of use of the premises under Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). Planning permission is therefore required. \r\n"
